+"""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""""
+
+The NNPot interface now runs model inference on Intel GPUs when |Gromacs| is
+built with SYCL (oneAPI DPC++) and a LibTorch with XPU support (PyTorch 2.5 or
+later). The model runs on the GPU assigned to the mdrun rank, which mdrun now
+passes to the MD modules. A LibTorch without XPU support is detected at
+configure time, and inference falls back to the CPU with a warning. Configuring
+also checks that the LibTorch headers compile with the selected C++ standard,
+since recent LibTorch versions require C++20.
